<title>HONG KONG: OLS public share offer 16.95 times subscribed.</title>
<headline>OLS public share offer 16.95 times subscribed.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Construction concern OLS Group Ltd said its initial public share offer was about 16.95 times subscribed.</p>
<p>The company offered 120 million new shares at HK$1.65 each. Of the total, 108 million shares were available for public subscription and 12 million shares were reserved to company employees on a preferential basis. Dealing in the shares is expected to start on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370  http://www.hk97.com</p>
